<title>USA: Community Investors to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Community Investors to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>BUCYRUS, Ohio 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Investors Bancorp Inc said it received permission from the Office of Thrift Supervision to repurchase five percent of its stock, or 33,312 shares.</p>
<p>The company said it had about 666,246 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
